Runs 19 to 21 (acme/noage): an ETag and only `s-maxage=600`, so no max-age line in the meta: never fresh. Run 20 at age 0: one request with If-None-Match, the fake answers 304, one write of the meta only. Run 21 (offline, age 34399): the copy at any age.
Runs 22 and 23 (acme/redir, a 301): exit 15 (R-IX7) and nothing kept, so run 23 asks again. Run 24 (acme/nm304, a 304 to a request with no If-None-Match): exit 15, nothing kept.
